    :attr:`jax.numpy.ndarray.at`, which lowers to an XLA Scatter operation:

    >>> x = jnp.ones(5)
    >>> indices = jnp.array([1, 2, 4])
    >>> values = jnp.array([2.0, 3.0, 4.0])

